          "execution_id": "execution_ec058709-99b0-407a-a276-803a1c52295c",
          "body": "I inspected the retained sources in this private conversation and reread the original W3C [Focus Visible guidance](https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/focus-visible). **Fact:** WCAG 2.2 criterion 2.4.7 (Level AA) says any keyboard-operable interface must have a mode in which the keyboard focus indicator is visible. The page was originally retrieved **2026-10-05 19:52:49.568 UTC**; rereading the retained copy did not refresh it. **Limitations:** This “Understanding” page is informative rather than normative, and the retained text is a bounded static extraction that omits scripts, images, and interactive content. I did not assess any particular website.",
